<title>ZIMBABWE: Lightning, drowning claim 52 Zimbabwe lives.</title>
<headline>Lightning, drowning claim 52 Zimbabwe lives.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some 30 Zimbabweans have been killed by lightning and 22 others have drowned since the November-April rainy season started three weeks ago, police reported on Wednesday.</p>
